          "label": "Our Story",
          "fields": {
            "body1": "Welcome to Pneuma Academy. Educating for Time and Eternity. It is with great delight and immense pleasure that I warmly welcome you to Pneuma Academy, a citadel of holistic education. Ours is an institution synonymous with creativity, academic excellence and Godly values. This great citadel of learning was birthed out of my immense love for children and passion for impacting knowledge.",
            "body2": "It was established on the 2nd of September 2019. The name PNEUMA ACADEMY was derived from the Greek word Pneuma which means the Spirit and Life of God.",
