        {
          "id": "story-modal",
          "label": "Story Modal",
          "fields": {
            "title": "Our School Story",
            "bodyHtml": "<h4>7+ YEARS OF BUILDING A CITADEL OF LEARNING.</h4>\n<p>Welcome to Pneuma Academy. Educating for Time and Eternity. It is with great delight and immense pleasure that I warmly welcome you to Pneuma Academy, a citadel of holistic education. Ours is an institution synonymous with creativity, academic excellence and Godly values. This great citadel of learning was birthed out of my immense love for children and passion for impacting knowledge. It was established on the 2nd of September 2019. <br /><br />The name PNEUMA ACADEMY was derived from the Greek word Pneuma which means the Spirit and Life of God. It is also the Greek word for the Holy Spirit. At Pneuma Academy, we believe that every child carries greatness within. Our passion is to nurture generations of godly, creative, confident, and purpose-driven leaders who will shine as lights in their communities and across the world. Located at No. 13 Woji Street, Woji, Port Harcourt. Pneuma Academy is more than a school — it is a place where destinies are shaped, values are built, and futures are transformed. We are committed to providing holistic education that develops every child academically, spiritually, morally, socially, emotionally, and physically. <br /><br />Guided by excellence, vision, and strong Godly values, we create a safe, inspiring, and engaging environment where children are encouraged to discover, develop, and maximize their God-given potentials. Our dedicated educators combine passion, professionalism, and innovation to ensure that learning is impactful, meaningful, and life-changing. At Pneuma Academy, education goes beyond the classroom. We nurture and raise critical thinkers, responsible leaders, creative problem-solvers, and children of integrity who are prepared to excel in every area of life and make lasting positive impact in their various fields of endeavor.</p>"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "head-message",
          "label": "Head of School Message",
          "fields": {
            "body": "<p>Dear Parents, choosing the right school is one of the most important decisions you will make for your child. At PNEUMA ACADEMY, we see education as a partnership built on trust, communication, and a shared commitment to helping every learner thrive.</p>",
            "image": "https://res.cloudinary.com/dxoorukfj/image/upload/v1779558277/jpjblxcw7qdo5lcndh84.png",
            "title": "<p>Building a Legacy of Learning.</p>",
            "eyebrow": "<p>A Message From The Founder.</p>",
